include README.md LICENSE THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md CONTRIBUTING.md SECURITY.md CHANGELOG.md
include romeo_mcp/README.md
recursive-include docs *.md *.svg *.png
recursive-include tools *.py *.md
recursive-include tests *.py *.md
